=== EVIDENCE PACK (non-lte-excitation, rebuilt) ===
# Evidence pack: Non-LTE excitation modelling (RADEX, LVG) (`non-lte-excitation`)

Scope: non-LTE line ratio modelling for density and temperature

Built from 370 non-held-out ALMA papers whose methods cards passed mechanical evidence verification (every quote below is verbatim from the paper). Years 2012-2026.
Matcher (regex over analysis steps): `radex|non[- ]lte|\blvg\b|large velocity gradient|myradex|ratran|collision(?:al)? rate|escape probability`
Tagging is by regex, so a few papers may be off-topic: ignore those.

