### 2024ApJ...963..163I: The ALMA Survey of 70 μm Dark High-mass Clumps in Early Stages (ASHES). X. Hot Gas Reveals Deeply Embedded Star Formation (2024; star_formation, milky_way_ism; large_program_or_survey)
- question: Kinetic temperatures and embedded star-formation activity in 12 70 μm dark IRDCs
