  - software: RADEX
  - assumption: T_kin = 300 K; n_H2 = 10^4 cm^-3; N_ortho-NH3 = 1.5×10^17 cm^-2; δv = 10 km s^-1 [Gas temperatures: "$T_{\rm {kin}}$ = 300 K, $n_{\rm H_{2}}$ = 10$^{4}$ cm$^{-3}$, $N_{\rm ortho-NH_{3}}$ = 1.5$\times$10$^{17}$ cm$^{-2}$, and $\delta v$ = 10 km s$^{-1}$ following the results obtained from (cite: Goddi2011)."]
  - validation: NH3 opacity needs confirmation through further hyperfine observations [Gas temperatures: "It needs to be confirmed through further hyperfine structure observations"]
