- result: Coupled-model SSB-b temperature = 100 ± not stated K [UCLCHEM: "| SSB-b | 100 | 4 | 1 | 15.6 | -6.6 | 0.71 |"]
- result: Coupled-model SSB-c temperature = 100 ± not stated K [UCLCHEM: "| SSB-c | 100 | 4 | 100 | 15.1 | -7.1 | 1.0 |"]
