- result: E. Outer Midplane H2 density = 7.0 ± not stated 10^6 cm^-3 [Table 4: "E. Outer Midplane | **$-$ 280** | **$+$ 0.0** | 8 | 7.0 | 3.7 | 6.5 | 3.1"]
- result: W. Upper Intermediate Layer line-of-sight CN column = 3.5 ± not stated 10^13 cm^-2 [Table 4: "W. Upper Intermediate Layer | **$+$ 230** | **$+$ 50** | 9 | 6.8 | 3.5 | 7.3 | 2.8"]
