- result: W. Lower Intermediate Layer line-of-sight CN column = 4.4 ± not stated 10^13 cm^-2 [Table 4: "W. Lower Intermediate Layer | **$+$ 230** | **$-$ 50** | 9 | 8.0 | 4.4 | 7.7 | 3.5"]
- result: W. Outer Midplane line-of-sight CN column = 4.2 ± not stated 10^13 cm^-2 [Table 4: "W. Outer Midplane | **$+$ 280** | **$+$ 0.0** | 7 | 7.3 | 4.2 | 5.8 | 3.8"]
